      "post": {
        "description": "Segari Product Details\n\nThis operation returns what the page at `url` shows when it is fetched. Currency, language and regional content are decided by the rendered page and the location it is fetched from, not by your URL: URL parameters that select them (for example a currency or language parameter) may be ignored. Read the currency and locale values in the response instead of assuming the ones in your URL.\n\n> **请求示例待验证。** 此接口的请求示例尚未在生产环境验证。静态示例用于说明请求格式，请替换为自己的参数。正式调用前，可用免费的报价模式（`X-AISA-Cost-Mode: quote`）查看预估费用。",
        "operationId": "post_segari_apis_v1_segari_product",
        "requestBody": {
